{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7a9a7893e3c87fcd819b16a0cf7df7b7bead789bcd5a63fcf47aa9c57d5de121","ja":"……おや～。\nまたスリップさせられました～。","zh":"……哎呀～\n又被打到打滑了～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"4395fd5a912bd0116d6ddcb45e03f3a6d04c13cc06e3768831b1cb45fa9744c8","ja":"……むう～……また、あの人……。","zh":"……唔～……又是那个人……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"0081efb185e3f90b75cad8af29ebce3a232cf24ac0349edc1d9b5f9d2e397434","ja":"お疲れ～！\nあっ、こないだのゲームやってんの……。","zh":"辛苦啦～！\n啊，在玩之前那个游戏吗……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"61bc093f2454e90f0bdadd4ae3fed28a1f23abd3a30dbb743de55160e9f6aead","ja":"って、どないしたん！？\n杏奈、めっちゃ怖い顔してるやん！","zh":"不对，这是怎么了！？\n杏奈，你的表情超级吓人啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"881aec5b82c450a15e964fdd8272f1b2250ef344a81fceff11ef083b757c894c","ja":"杏奈がそんなに怒るなんて……。\nい、いったい何があったんだ……？","zh":"杏奈居然会生那么大的气……\n到、到底发生什么事了……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"5f109b37446a6f2bb969ef65443cb8cc4768b9b56aacfe5912074fb7763b55db","ja":"実はですね～。今日は全国の人達と\nオンライン対戦をしていたのですが～……。","zh":"其实是这样的～今天我和全国各地的玩家\n进行了线上对战～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"648f9121a0e3f0cf889c24606b14de3be79add3c19e6803d85e75da6482efde4","ja":"その、ひとりが……美也さんが初心者って、\nわかって……しつこく絡んできてる、の……。","zh":"其中一人……看出美也小姐是新手，\n就……死缠烂打地找她麻烦……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"b3e58784e9ae710898a9a8fca798a4e21ff8b07121d376332157f287a2eaf35d","ja":"ねえ……美也さん、代わって。\n杏奈がこの人……やっつける、から。","zh":"那个……美也，换我来吧。\n杏奈……会把这个人打倒的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"4cee60216f2de009298a24106aa86b303a4551c7445d130b4dfae7e9430209f4","ja":"む～ん、自分の力で勝てないのは悔しいですが……\nここは杏奈ちゃんに託しますよ～。","zh":"唔～虽然没能凭自己的力量赢下来很不甘心……\n不过这里就托付给小杏奈啦～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"bb1df07428ea40686488697dcf54ec002321ab2673830cd9728066d727ab6145","ja":"そんなら私らは、杏奈を応援せんとあかんな！","zh":"那我们就必须要给杏奈加油才行呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"a32e82e52d1934062f81f83546122ff727ea1b4a222f7cd6bffc73db1c89ca37","ja":"いけー、杏奈！\nそんなやつに負けるんやないで～！","zh":"冲啊——，杏奈！\n可不能输给那种家伙啊～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"6825f49545cba1d566b1759446c445a870720b8481eafbf876e5eefd19b9ac76","ja":"……って、はやっ！　そんなとこで\nショートカットできたんだ！？","zh":"……等等，好快！那种地方\n居然能抄近道吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"626b9ee0e7fcd6f81c34b3161791a796208c2e63284c0d813092c461f92bfb73","ja":"ええでー！\nこの調子なら、トップ間違いなしや！","zh":"太棒啦——！\n照这个势头，绝对能拿第一名！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"5715daa993b721664151d14bb0450263c3a5bd44bdf80a31ca64349e4b2d7708","ja":"でも、相手も相当速いよ！\nうわっ、追い抜かれちゃった！","zh":"但是，对方也相当快哦！\n哇，被超过去了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"ab77eae19482bb4fdbb2349a8f2335dae54c5f705d59aba478635d45aec2675e","ja":"大丈夫……この、アイテムで……\nすぐ逆転できる、から……よし、今！","zh":"没关系……用这个、道具……\n马上就能、逆转……好，就是现在！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"b07287904cc15de27a2c758f71ff24ae4ffe75bad564632514884353daef00cb","ja":"おお～！　追い抜いて……そのままゴール！\nさすが杏奈ちゃん、ですな～！","zh":"哦哦～！超过去了……直接冲线！\n真不愧是杏奈，太厉害啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1470.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"7ddeb8d16969170921830c35b52a0d49106b0b81724d123e5eb58ba95d3a4e1f","ja":"えへへ……♪\nこれでちょっとは……こりてくれると、いいけど……。","zh":"嘿嘿……♪\n要是这样能稍微……让她吸取点教训就好了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
